---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="Affiliate disclosure for Japan Living Edit."
  pathname="/disclosure/"
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Disclosure</p>
    <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
    <p>
      Japan Living Edit may use affiliate links in the future. At launch, the site does
      not include active affiliate links or affiliate tracking scripts.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="text-block">
    <p>
      If affiliate links are introduced later, relevant pages should identify them
      clearly. Editorial opinions should remain independent, and no brand partnership
      should be implied unless it is accurate and approved.
    </p>
    <p>
      This page is structured to support future disclosure updates when affiliate
      programs are actually active.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
